'''The Enmity Divine''' is a [[unique]] {{il|Imperial Staff}}.

==Mechanics==
{{c|mod|Grants Summon Harbinger of Brutality Skill}}: This modifier grants the {{sl|Summon Harbinger of Brutality}} skill, which summons an immortal Harbinger [[minion]].

Once every 20 seconds, the Harbinger of Brutality minion will apply a buff to the character called "The Enmity Divine". The buff lasts 8 seconds and grants the following bonuses:
* 50% increased [[damage]]
* 15% reduced [[damage taken]]
* 30% increased [[attack speed]]
* 30% increased [[movement speed]] 

Socketed gems are [[support gem|supported]] by level 1 {{il|Chance to Bleed Support}}. All support stats are accounted for, including the cost and reservation multiplier.

{{Item acquisition}}

When the unique pieces are placed correctly in the inventory or stash, they will all vanish, and the player will be left with the forged unique item.

